tains. Until launch is confirmed by an independent positive signal (worktree existence plus a first durable checkpoint), RUNNING means only that something once intended to run. Recommended mitigation: treat worktree-present plus first-checkpoint-posted as the launch-success gate, and have the monitor verify launch BEFORE beginning cadence monitoring rather than assuming its subject exists.\n\nSTATE AT HANDOFF: unchanged and safe. Branch feature/pp3g-qfOy-investigation-task-decision-ready-comparison-not-a at 7dd054be, preserved evidence intact (20 files, 2654 insertions), working tree clean of investigation work. Nothing written, nothing fixed, nothing dispatched by me.\n\nOPEN FOR ORCHESTRATOR — the six actions in my prior observation stand, of which three are blocking any restart of #228: confirm/redo the Builder launch, release the stale pp3g-qfOy lock on #228, and close the orphaned 44-hour session #1. Phase 2 (heavy post-hoc audit) has no completed deliverable to audit and should not be dispatched against #228 until a Builder actually produces report.md.\n\nPhase-1 monitoring closed: trigger fired, evidenced, reported, escalated.","created_at":"2026-08-08T03:48:43.341113685Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:QnesEmvvqpIlj5hRSf8Xgt2fnafYnIlPGS2VybcvWMc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3GZ1ioft4osqukNxK8O3e9w3xIKe6PwYDD2kPknQ0QMAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAcBN82npjw7B8St/Urb+W965BA50JcNHNzWkIJJv5x5KPCUs1StLkJWHWITndwbi70SFjJY+i5Peuy+thajzGCQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:QnesEmvvqpIlj5hRSf8Xgt2fnafYnIlPGS2VybcvWMc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3GZ1ioft4osqukNxK8O3e9w3xIKe6PwYDD2kPknQ0QMAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKl+zl9+qL3gjaZit7mR4tkq5dsbuv8gyM4ilwhWjAuZ4lniUCIHIygkvFstuSrxlMTwhzNh1xaV2g1VnDqp4QI="}
